+<TD width=35% BGCOLOR=#FBF5EF>
+<B>Mode register write data - for non-LPDDR2 modes. For LPDDR2, these 16-bits are interpreted as Writes: \'7bMR Addr[7:0], MR Data[7:0]\'7d. Reads: \'7bMR Addr[7:0], Don't Care[7:0]\'7d</B>
